cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this specification, please cite it as below."
title: "slhdsa-spec: an EasyCrypt specification of FIPS 205 (SLH-DSA)"
abstract: >-
  An EasyCrypt specification of the stateless hash-based signature standard
  SLH-DSA (FIPS 205): the twelve parameter sets, Algorithms 1 to 25, the SHA2
  and SHAKE instantiations, pure and pre-hash signing, with validation
  theories checked against the standard.
type: software
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-11-13"
repository-code: "https://github.com/nirapod-labs/slhdsa-spec"
authors:
  - given-names: "H.M. Yousuf"
    email: "hmyousuf@nirapod.org"
  - given-names: "Rifat Ahmed"
    email: "rifatahmed@nirapod.org"
license:
  - CC0-1.0
  - Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - SLH-DSA
  - FIPS 205
  - SPHINCS+
  - EasyCrypt
  - formal specification
  - post-quantum cryptography
